@base = https://avans-college-auth.onrender.com

### Register (409 if this username already exists)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student","password":"a long classroom passphrase"}

### Login; JetBrains HTTP Client stores the token for the next request
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student","password":"a long classroom passphrase"}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### The authenticated principal
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing token → 401
GET {{base}}/me

### Invalid token → 401
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Wrong password → 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student","password":"a different classroom passphrase"}
